sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as QuantApp
    participant AD as 适配器(币安/A股/腾讯)
    participant I as IndicatorEngine
    participant S as RuleEngine
    participant AM as AlertManager
    participant P as PaperEngine
    participant D as Dashboard

    A->>A: init_schema + PaperEngine
    A->>AD: connect() × N
    A->>A: spawn _adapter_loop × N (监督重启)
    loop 每适配器事件流
        AD-->>A: yield Tick / Candle
        A->>D: update_tick / update_candle (+延迟标注)
        alt Candle.is_closed
            A->>I: update(symbol, candle)
            I-->>A: snapshot
            A->>S: scan(RuleContext)
            S-->>A: list[Alert](含 direction)
            loop 每条 Alert
                A->>AM: publish(alert)
                AM-->>A: published?
                opt published 且 paper.enabled 且 direction
                    A->>P: on_signal(SignalRecord)
                    alt auto
                        P->>P: 滑点价/费用/数量 → Order→Fill→PositionEvent→落库
                    else manual
                        P->>P: 入 pending 队列
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
    A->>P: _pending_watchdog: expire_pending() (300s)
    Note over A,D: 键盘 y 确认 / n 忽略 / m 切模式 → 命令队列
